<title>USA: B&amp;H Ocean Carriers Ltd year profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>B&amp;H Ocean Carriers Ltd year profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.98     loss	 $0.21</p>
<p> Net profit		 3,886     loss	   859</p>
<p> Revs			20,928		   15,205</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company acquired substantially all the assets of B&amp;H Maritime Carriers Ltd in 1996</p>
<p>1996 year reflects extension of estimated useful lives of its vessels to 30 years from 22 years, leading to an increase of net income by $2.3 million, or $0.58 a share.</p>
